Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堅持一分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.81,0:00:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預備 開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體保持筆直
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還剩10秒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會覺得累是因為軀幹力量太弱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肌肉不是越強壯越好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是強化鍛煉啦啦隊員所必須的肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔能加入太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫大忙了 我也想差不多該開始練習托舉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 翔說過參加不了托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能參加托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法我還是會教的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們那照葫蘆畫瓢的外行練法 萬一受傷可就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就拜託啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托舉就是阿遠之前說的團體體操吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠尖子 底座 後點來組成吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也學習過了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於有啦啦隊的樣子了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 正式啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:52.28,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}結束漫不經心度過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:56.29,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}滿心想要脫離現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:01.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我總是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.13,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牽著我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:11.93,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}帶我去看新的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:14.30,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界變幻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.39,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邁出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:19.64,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛帶來了變化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.81,0:02:25.52,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再擔心 我們在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.11,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:31.86,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}雖然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:38.54,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不試試沒法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:45.09,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能觸碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:48.17,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我們不再孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.34,0:02:53.34,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:52.29,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:56.29,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:01.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.09,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:11.93,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:14.31,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.39,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:19.64,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.81,0:02:25.52,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.11,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:31.86,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:38.54,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.08,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:45.09,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:48.17,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.34,0:02:53.34,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托舉包括很多技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畫技好爛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比阿一還爛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土器上的畫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是祈願豐收吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重點不在這兒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管哪種表演 都少不了人塔技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要把尖子托到底座胸部高度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後高舉雙手 尖子站在頂端 這叫做高臂托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把尖子拋投到空中的動作叫做籃子拋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很考驗功底的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 趕緊決定位置開始訓練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思拜託你們看店 多謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能有個室內練習場就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找地方借用一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,區體育館之類的應該能抽籤借用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不貴的話哪都行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,籌集部費吧 到時候還得購置{\u1}隊服{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:30.50,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(897.333,618.666)}uniform
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是{\u1}中性時代{\u0}記得買中性款的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.00,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(556,622.667)}unisex
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是想說unisex這個詞而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隊服得花不少錢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:我有個提議
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:我和翔想了一下位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:底座 一郎 弦 阿遠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:後點 溝口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:尖子 阿晴 我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得做那個？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\u1}尖子{\u0}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.62,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(618.666,620)}top
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看這{\u1}首頁{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:13.17,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(702.667,620)}top畫面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\u1}冠軍{\u0}之爭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.17,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,620)}top
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫我拿下{\u1}杯子{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:18.76,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(725.333,620)}cup
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要{\u1}大特寫{\u0}啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.63,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(662.667,620)}up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的{\u1}杯裝{\u0}炒麵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.47,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(685.333,620)}cup
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,hop step jump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好啊 阿晴當尖子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跟我換嗎 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 就體型來說能當尖子的只有阿一和阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於這件事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 當不了尖子...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怕生 所以不喜歡出風頭是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:05:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溝口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴你們一個好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 寫真雜誌嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,DREAMS 我們大學的女子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經談妥了 下次一起訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共同練習
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女子啦啦隊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷你裙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷你裙耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是不是當成聯誼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想近距離看到托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後點的動作我還不太明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想看看底座的動作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溝口 什麼時候共同訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩周後
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 在那之前完成人塔和高臂托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請那邊看一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女子啦啦隊有正規教練
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好請人家指點一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩周時間能練會嗎 翔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勉強可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 讓女子啦啦隊見識見識我們的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠也是嗎 我也不能輸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羡慕阿晴和阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子人氣可高了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後點 用力扶穩了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後屈膝 利用伸展的力量靠全身的力氣抬起來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子一口氣站起來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 翔說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一口氣站起來更容易保持平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下麵 換班
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屈膝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用伸展的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠全身的力量 抬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙腿蹬直
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上體挺直
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我沒能撐住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 阿遠 是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 會慢慢熟練的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我扶著 放心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿一 我辦不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:58.62,上标,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一:只要掌握訣竅 阿晴很快就能學會的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和阿晴開始做一件新的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 高臂托舉也已經有模有樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一果然厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起來 站直了 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道早就該說的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恐高
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是小時候的事了嗎 你平時也常去屋頂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是不敢往下看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看大家那麼努力 一直說不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該道歉的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝擊性的事實
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看氣氛行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後天就是共同練習了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能延期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 還有松鼠次郎老師呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就請他替阿晴當一回尖子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共同訓練我去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為啥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒聽說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得去...打工
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是第一次聽說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能請假嗎 打什麼工？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站前的...高田牧舍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從明天起要去那裡打工來著
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之不行 我去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷你裙都不看？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這麼回事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣 瘮的慌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 來客人了 快去招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來今後夠嗆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 你這祥的笑容還怎麼當啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 我沒發現
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一的媽媽以前就是啦啦隊員
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有阿一想成立啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些我根本都沒察覺到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就我一個人當尖子好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你請教練指導一下翻騰和動作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弦：能看到小短裙也賺到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠：阿晴 明天會去的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5 6 7 8 GO GO DREAMS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WE ARE NO.1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大點聲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:22.56,上标,,0,0,0,,5 6 7 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個女生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們幾個在幹嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是約好共同練習的男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共同練習？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是高城 DREAMS的OG（前隊員）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是教練
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是男子啦啦隊的橋本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在隊裡的時候還沒有純男生的啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的隊名叫什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隊名還沒定 這才成立一個月
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什麼 一開始不是說你們隊很有實力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以共同練習對DREAMS也會有很大意義嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切從相遇的那一刻開始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒辦法 既然已經答應了 就看看你們的訓練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們才成立不久
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請務必多給些建議
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底座 手肘不夠高 再抬高些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後點別東張西望
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子 姿勢不標準 胳膊伸直
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 先下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你倆是什麼位置的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是底座
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子...勉強算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼叫勉強算 你換下他試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是來訓練的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 阿晴他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人塔 我試試
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別往下看 膝蓋伸直
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股再用力些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO DREAMS
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們覺得托舉動作怎樣才能穩定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基礎穩固？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 一是基礎 還有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.67,0:14:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技術
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 二是技術
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們男生總喜歡憑蠻力做動作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有了技術 力量不足的女生也能完成得又穩又漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有一點就是信任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有信任同伴 才能做到高難度技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之所以尖子敢於在高處起跳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為他相信隊友一定會接住自己
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你缺少的正是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之所以站不上人塔 是因為你不信任隊友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信任嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的飲料已經出了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又見面了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是DREAMS的隊員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫酒井千裕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:16:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教練從不會斥責沒幹勁的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 我剛才...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本隊長 之前胡扯八道的就是他們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡扯八道？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 你倆怎麼來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來商討下個月合作表演的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我來介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陽明大學SPARKS的隊長堂本和花咲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是堂本仁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是花咲薫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二位好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教練 你和他們是什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是命志院男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦隊？全男生組成的啦啦隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎同志的加入
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 如果只是因為看起來光鮮想練著玩的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勸你們還是放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們隊每年都有好幾個人退出
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊不是能鬧著玩的運動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本說得對
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果想上進 最好還是找位老師
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這段時間 有教練指導嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有 今天沒能來的翔...是個練過體操的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔？你是說德川翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你認識翔嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是放棄啦啦隊了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:17:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每個人都有不想被問及的秘密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是翔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.92,上标,NTP,0,0,0,,翔：共同練習怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫上翔一起開今天的反省會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也沒心情去向日葵食堂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來我家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是之前說的屋頂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溝口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點都不高
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說 既然有這麼個地方 能不能拿來當訓練場啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實可以
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反省會現在開始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要說今天該反省的內容呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是沒能和女子啦啦隊的女生們說話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說和OG搞好了關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你？真的假的 話說啥叫OG
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是「額頭凸起」的簡稱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 辛苦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是之前說的屋頂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個話題已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說共同練習怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們 女子啦啦隊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比咱們的訓練厲害多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帥氣得不得了 雖然不甘心承認
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們真是遜爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遜得沒法看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說我不夠信任大家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊不是靠一個人努力就能成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管跳躍的人還是接的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有彼此信賴的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技巧才能完成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在失敗的時候放棄 才會真的失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有堅持到成功的那一刻 才會成功
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:20:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是松下創始人松下幸之助說的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就堅持到成功為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 拜託你以後訓練再斯巴達一些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隊名也該想想了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MEGANES(四眼們)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四眼就你一個好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cherry Boys
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.49,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：櫻桃(cheer)在英文的口語代表“處女”，也有“處男”的意思。\N基本上英文的情況不分男女，但日文將其加上了“boy”變成了“處男”。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是只有你一個好不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有主意 松鼠次郎s
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是不認可全男生組建啦啦隊的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是那些說我們做不到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及溝口用名言隱藏的心聲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠的過度缺乏自信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴的內疚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔內心隱藏的煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有想要打破的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如不受女生歡迎的自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想打破一直以來的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打破那些說我們不行的人的常識
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打破我們自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞 BREAK
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKER
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,決定是BERAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是它了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土帥土帥的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就比MEGANES差那麼一點
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱們七個一起去破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:22.04,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(675.133,502.047)}{\c&HD59FE5&}想要破壞的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:22.04,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(651.59,508.486)}{\c&HE4DB75&}想要破壞的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:22.04,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}想要破壞的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:23.49,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:25.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:26.74,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:29.50,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.87,0:22:35.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大聲回應
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:38.75,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,嶄新大門打開的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.84,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像緊緊握住的拳頭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:45.18,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,決意堅定地響起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:48.64,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散發的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.98,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話感覺能改變些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:54.90,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你總是在尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:58.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:01.78,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:05.03,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自棄＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要輸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.49,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上應援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:13.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打氣的動作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:16.50,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:20.09,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂頭喪氣抱怨「到極限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:23.42,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破極限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:26.76,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.93,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.06,0:23:33.27,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利的姿勢＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.40,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,連同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:40.23,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著邂逅閃耀笑容的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:43.15,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:47.78,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.87,0:22:35.17,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:38.75,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.84,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:45.18,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:48.64,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:51.98,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:54.90,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:58.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:01.78,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:05.03,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.49,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:13.12,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:16.50,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:20.09,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:23.42,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:26.76,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.93,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.06,0:23:33.27,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:36.40,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:40.23,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至於失落成這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.71,0:23:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意料外的黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.37,0:23:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cherry Boys解散吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:23:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要在臺上耍個帥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定能立刻交到一兩個女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩個？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一起把一切都破壞掉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,

